{"id":"twitter:1896211911664181503","tweet_id":"1896211911664181503","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1896211911664181503","title":"@Ichigosrevival @DeTocqueville14 @Eslatt13 @mefimus Isolationism isn't a new debate. John Adams and his son John Quincy Adams would debate it all the ","summary":"@Ichigosrevival @DeTocqueville14 @Eslatt13 @mefimus Isolationism isn't a new debate. John Adams and his son John Quincy Adams would debate it all the time. The elder being forced into world events, and the younger arguing against entanglement. My guess Owl has a meme or two with John Quincy Adams quotes It's not all made up","date":"2025-03-02","published":"2025-03-02T14:52:04+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1896210965835948054","reply_tweet_id":"1896210965835948054","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Ichigosrevival @DeTocqueville14 @Eslatt13 @mefimus Isolationism isn&#x27;t a new debate. John Adams and his son John Quincy Adams would debate it all the time.<br><br>The elder being forced into world events, and the younger arguing against entanglement.<br><br>My guess Owl has a meme or two with John Quincy Adams quotes<br><br>It&#x27;s not all made up</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1896211911664181503","display_date":"March 02, 2025 · 14:52 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
