{"id":"twitter:1895889753045975336","tweet_id":"1895889753045975336","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1895889753045975336","title":"Did you know throughout the war Ukraine didn't set the draft age until 27? They wanted to give youth a chance to grow up without seeing war. Volunteer","summary":"Did you know throughout the war Ukraine didn't set the draft age until 27? They wanted to give youth a chance to grow up without seeing war. Volunteers, of course, have always been allowed. and the only reason there is a draft is because russia won't leave. https://x.com/CantGovernMe/status/1895889214342050137","date":"2025-03-01","published":"2025-03-01T17:31:55+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Did you know throughout the war Ukraine didn&#x27;t set the draft age until 27?<br><br>They wanted to give youth a chance to grow up without seeing war.<br><br>Volunteers, of course, have always been allowed.<br><br>and the only reason there is a draft is because russia won&#x27;t leave. <a href=\"https://x.com/CantGovernMe/status/1895889214342050137\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/CantGovernMe/status/1895889214342050137</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1895889753045975336","display_date":"March 01, 2025 · 17:31 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
