{"id":"twitter:1895825125414687231","tweet_id":"1895825125414687231","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1895825125414687231","title":"@MadDog4Anarchy It is not a strawman The revival in statea rights came after Brown vs Board of Education. It was George Talmedge who coined the phrase","summary":"@MadDog4Anarchy It is not a strawman The revival in statea rights came after Brown vs Board of Education. It was George Talmedge who coined the phrase, \"we are a constitutional republic, not a democracy\" in his book \"You and Segregation\" Solwell is wrong. Desegregation was good for schools","date":"2025-03-01","published":"2025-03-01T13:15:07+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/MadDog4Anarchy/status/1895824312399249876","reply_tweet_id":"1895824312399249876","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@MadDog4Anarchy It is not a strawman<br><br>The revival in statea rights came after Brown vs Board of Education.<br><br>It was George Talmedge who coined the phrase, &quot;we are a constitutional republic, not a democracy&quot; in his book &quot;You and Segregation&quot;<br><br>Solwell is wrong. Desegregation was good for schools</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1895825125414687231","display_date":"March 01, 2025 · 13:15 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
