{"id":"twitter:1894908147757654208","tweet_id":"1894908147757654208","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1894908147757654208","title":"@RepDonBacon I am pretty sure our energy exports and extraction are at an all time high. I think Keystone starts in Canada and brings shale oil down t","summary":"@RepDonBacon I am pretty sure our energy exports and extraction are at an all time high. I think Keystone starts in Canada and brings shale oil down to America for refinement. I think we should do things like reform the Jones Act to enhance energy moving in the US.","date":"2025-02-27","published":"2025-02-27T00:31:22+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/RepDonBacon/status/1894886793859784749","reply_tweet_id":"1894886793859784749","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@RepDonBacon I am pretty sure our energy exports and extraction are at an all time high.<br><br>I think Keystone starts in Canada and brings shale oil down to America for refinement.<br><br>I think we should do things like reform the Jones Act to enhance energy moving in the US.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1894908147757654208","display_date":"February 27, 2025 · 00:31 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
