{"id":"twitter:1894034358886907940","tweet_id":"1894034358886907940","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1894034358886907940","title":"@milan_elm @southerntails1 @DOGE Mathematically the election could have swung by 180k votes. Trump has silent support for sure, but not all Trump vote","summary":"@milan_elm @southerntails1 @DOGE Mathematically the election could have swung by 180k votes. Trump has silent support for sure, but not all Trump voters are MAGA. It makes no sense, but little does about US Election systems. He won an unpopular vote. They win by suppression and division more than growth.","date":"2025-02-24","published":"2025-02-24T14:39:15+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/milan_elm/status/1894032161826558369","reply_tweet_id":"1894032161826558369","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@milan_elm @southerntails1 @DOGE Mathematically the election could have swung by 180k votes.<br><br>Trump has silent support for sure, but not all Trump voters are MAGA.<br><br>It makes no sense, but little does about US Election systems.<br><br>He won an unpopular vote. They win by suppression and division more than growth.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1894034358886907940","display_date":"February 24, 2025 · 14:39 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
