{"id":"twitter:1892770808944034214","tweet_id":"1892770808944034214","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1892770808944034214","title":"@dromanocpm John Flavell started to write about metacognition in 1979 and then a big influence was Vygotsky getting translated into English for popula","summary":"@dromanocpm John Flavell started to write about metacognition in 1979 and then a big influence was Vygotsky getting translated into English for popular markets same time. Fun fact reading research and DoD both cite Vygotsky. same time in 1984 (Palinscar & Brown, 1984; Chutki, 1984)","date":"2025-02-21","published":"2025-02-21T02:58:21+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1892770006271746479","reply_tweet_id":"1892770006271746479","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@dromanocpm John Flavell started to write about metacognition in 1979 and then a big influence was Vygotsky getting translated into English for popular markets same time.<br><br>Fun fact reading research and DoD both cite Vygotsky. same time in 1984 (Palinscar &amp; Brown, 1984; Chutki, 1984)</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1892770808944034214","display_date":"February 21, 2025 · 02:58 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1892770006271746479","tweet_id":"1892770006271746479","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1892770006271746479","title":"@dromanocpm It's the same one we see with reinforcement learning LLMs, people just think they invented something new That was Ariel in 1987, who reall","summary":"@dromanocpm It's the same one we see with reinforcement learning LLMs, people just think they invented something new That was Ariel in 1987, who really started to create the AI model from information processing theory","date":"2025-02-21","published":"2025-02-21T02:55:10+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1892769573977411947","reply_tweet_id":"1892769573977411947","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@dromanocpm It&#x27;s the same one we see with reinforcement learning LLMs, people just think they invented something new<br><br>That was Ariel in 1987, who really started to create the AI model from information processing theory</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1892770006271746479","display_date":"February 21, 2025 · 02:55 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1892769573977411947","tweet_id":"1892769573977411947","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1892769573977411947","title":"@dromanocpm The computer was used as a metaphor. It began n 1956 with George Armitage Miller's 7 + or - 2 short term memory studies (people don't use ","summary":"@dromanocpm The computer was used as a metaphor. It began n 1956 with George Armitage Miller's 7 + or - 2 short term memory studies (people don't use 7 + or - 2 anymore) LT was divided into semantic, episodic, and procedural memories Atkinson & Shiffron developed the model in 1968 https://t.co/NFXHPsXztq","date":"2025-02-21","published":"2025-02-21T02:53:27+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/dromanocpm/status/1892768066079248741","reply_tweet_id":"1892768066079248741","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@dromanocpm The computer was used as a metaphor.<br><br> It began n 1956 with George Armitage Miller&#x27;s 7 + or - 2 short term memory studies (people don&#x27;t  use 7 + or - 2 anymore)<br><br>LT was divided into semantic, episodic, and procedural memories<br><br>Atkinson &amp; Shiffron developed the model in 1968 <a href=\"https://t.co/NFXHPsXztq\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/NFXHPsXztq</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/e5532cd5ff6e8db8ca3e92050c90c4b7.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1892769573977411947","display_date":"February 21, 2025 · 02:53 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/e5532cd5ff6e8db8ca3e92050c90c4b7.jpg"]}
