{"id":"twitter:1892739281229083024","tweet_id":"1892739281229083024","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1892739281229083024","title":"@prestonstew_ @Fella6H @_edgegroup @wilendhornets I lost the video but did you folks see the 3-D printed 5 round drum that can be attached to drones? ","summary":"@prestonstew_ @Fella6H @_edgegroup @wilendhornets I lost the video but did you folks see the 3-D printed 5 round drum that can be attached to drones? It's not about buying drones. You need production units at the Battalion or Company level That's the future people are living now. https://t.co/Qean9ZBl1h","date":"2025-02-21","published":"2025-02-21T00:53:04+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1892736267604951071","reply_tweet_id":"1892736267604951071","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@prestonstew_ @Fella6H @_edgegroup @wilendhornets I lost the video but did you folks see the 3-D printed 5 round drum that can be attached to drones?<br><br>It&#x27;s not about buying drones. You need production units at the Battalion or Company level<br><br>That&#x27;s the future people are living now. <a href=\"https://t.co/Qean9ZBl1h\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/Qean9ZBl1h</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/861cea703c9298b7ab63ae9869ba7418.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1892739281229083024","display_date":"February 21, 2025 · 00:53 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/861cea703c9298b7ab63ae9869ba7418.jpg"]}
