{"id":"twitter:1892603176357896325","tweet_id":"1892603176357896325","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1892603176357896325","title":"Which party makes the debt @smerconish? Don't let folks misquote Zelensky about half of 200,000,000 missing. 70% went to Manufacturing in the US. That","summary":"Which party makes the debt @smerconish? Don't let folks misquote Zelensky about half of 200,000,000 missing. 70% went to Manufacturing in the US. That's what Zelensky meant. The numbers banded about don't reach Ukraine. They go to machinists making 155mm shells in PA.","date":"2025-02-20","published":"2025-02-20T15:52:14+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Which party makes the debt @smerconish?<br><br>Don&#x27;t let folks misquote Zelensky about half of 200,000,000 missing. <br><br>70% went to Manufacturing in the US.<br><br>That&#x27;s what Zelensky meant. The numbers banded about don&#x27;t reach Ukraine. They go to machinists making 155mm shells in PA.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1892603176357896325","display_date":"February 20, 2025 · 15:52 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
