{"id":"twitter:1892571306563920042","tweet_id":"1892571306563920042","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1892571306563920042","title":"@NArthound No, that was with @dromanocpm and drainpipe dot io We were developing tools to spot botnets. We used an adtech data structure, but that's p","summary":"@NArthound No, that was with @dromanocpm and drainpipe dot io We were developing tools to spot botnets. We used an adtech data structure, but that's proprietary. It was kinda easy to spot the bots, but everything is easier with historical data sets","date":"2025-02-20","published":"2025-02-20T13:45:36+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/NArthound/status/1892570570820059338","reply_tweet_id":"1892570570820059338","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@NArthound No, that was with @dromanocpm and drainpipe dot io<br><br>We were developing tools to spot botnets. We used an adtech data structure, but that&#x27;s proprietary.<br><br>It was kinda easy to spot the bots, but everything is easier with historical data sets</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1892571306563920042","display_date":"February 20, 2025 · 13:45 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
