{"id":"twitter:1892054565958111242","tweet_id":"1892054565958111242","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1892054565958111242","title":"@PensiveFire @slayerofmoskali @elisabethinwa @terryvaughn1 @marcorubio There are so many collections, you will find ones you like to support. The #Too","summary":"@PensiveFire @slayerofmoskali @elisabethinwa @terryvaughn1 @marcorubio There are so many collections, you will find ones you like to support. The #ToonieTuesday team is very active on #FiverFriday But #ToonieTuesday happens every Tuesday with the goal of getting folks to chip in two bucks if you can It's a fun crew too.","date":"2025-02-19","published":"2025-02-19T03:32:15+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/PensiveFire/status/1892053407491404251","reply_tweet_id":"1892053407491404251","tags":["ToonieTuesday","FiverFriday","ToonieTuesday"],"body_html":"<p>@PensiveFire @slayerofmoskali @elisabethinwa @terryvaughn1 @marcorubio There are so many collections, you will find ones you like to support.<br><br>The #ToonieTuesday team is very active on #FiverFriday<br><br>But #ToonieTuesday happens every Tuesday with the goal of getting folks to chip in two bucks if you can<br><br>It&#x27;s a fun crew too.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1892054565958111242","display_date":"February 19, 2025 · 03:32 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
