{"id":"twitter:1891442571861283061","tweet_id":"1891442571861283061","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1891442571861283061","title":"Rchest man in the world came for your salary just so he could give all the money to @spaceX to chase his fever dream of colonizing Mars Why must @spac","summary":"Rchest man in the world came for your salary just so he could give all the money to @spaceX to chase his fever dream of colonizing Mars Why must @spaceX colonize Mars? To save human consciousness, silly, that's why you can't have a paycheck. Be a good unemployed American https://t.co/XAs5gGSyik","date":"2025-02-17","published":"2025-02-17T11:00:25+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Rchest man in the world came for your salary just so he could give all the money to @spaceX to chase his fever dream of colonizing Mars<br><br>Why must @spaceX colonize Mars?<br><br>To save human consciousness, silly, that&#x27;s why you can&#x27;t have a paycheck. <br><br>Be a good unemployed American <a href=\"https://t.co/XAs5gGSyik\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/XAs5gGSyik</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/80d7e7519d19cb93218541631547bdf8.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1891442571861283061","display_date":"February 17, 2025 · 11:00 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/80d7e7519d19cb93218541631547bdf8.jpg"]}
