{"id":"twitter:1890525255115903162","tweet_id":"1890525255115903162","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1890525255115903162","title":"@CiaoQuirkTax It is also en vogue to blame the guns and the gays on the drugs, now, Then, Szasz popularity in Libertarian movement was more around the","summary":"@CiaoQuirkTax It is also en vogue to blame the guns and the gays on the drugs, now, Then, Szasz popularity in Libertarian movement was more around the decriminalization of all drugs. The 1980 race, when the LP got 1,000,000 that was the most LP ever got till then. Bunch of Koch addicts","date":"2025-02-14","published":"2025-02-14T22:15:19+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1890524226303480137","reply_tweet_id":"1890524226303480137","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@CiaoQuirkTax It is also en vogue to blame the guns and the gays on the  drugs, now,<br><br>Then, Szasz popularity in  Libertarian movement was more around the decriminalization of all drugs.<br><br>The 1980 race, when the LP got 1,000,000 that was the most LP ever got till then.<br><br>Bunch of Koch addicts</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1890525255115903162","display_date":"February 14, 2025 · 22:15 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
