{"id":"twitter:2048824286379389380","tweet_id":"2048824286379389380","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2048824286379389380","title":"After the war there was a policy that all people in exile must return to their homeland For Ukrainians this meant trading German occupation for a retu","summary":"After the war there was a policy that all people in exile must return to their homeland For Ukrainians this meant trading German occupation for a return to Soviet Occupation Bahrianyi detailed all the russian crimes against humanity https://t.co/gurJFhf3tQ","date":"2026-04-27","published":"2026-04-27T17:59:09+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2048823338378621191","reply_tweet_id":"2048823338378621191","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>After the war there was a policy that all people in exile must return to their homeland<br><br>For Ukrainians this meant trading German occupation for a return to Soviet Occupation<br><br>Bahrianyi detailed all the russian crimes against humanity <a href=\"https://t.co/gurJFhf3tQ\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/gurJFhf3tQ</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/4a5c663e41d31b889fdb0bbb24642983.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2048824286379389380","display_date":"April 27, 2026 · 17:59 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/4a5c663e41d31b889fdb0bbb24642983.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:2048823338378621191","tweet_id":"2048823338378621191","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2048823338378621191","title":"After escaping the German prison. Bahrianyi joined the OUN and worked in the propaganda department. He wrote patriotic songs and various articles. Bah","summary":"After escaping the German prison. Bahrianyi joined the OUN and worked in the propaganda department. He wrote patriotic songs and various articles. Bahrianyi also drew caricatures and posters for agitation https://t.co/qoWfFHWDJg","date":"2026-04-27","published":"2026-04-27T17:55:23+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2048808848333455810","reply_tweet_id":"2048808848333455810","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>After escaping the German prison.<br><br>Bahrianyi  joined the OUN and worked in the propaganda department. He wrote patriotic songs  and various articles. Bahrianyi also drew caricatures and posters for agitation <a href=\"https://t.co/qoWfFHWDJg\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/qoWfFHWDJg</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/f644721b90b44af6fb9686bb05a74005.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2048823338378621191","display_date":"April 27, 2026 · 17:55 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/f644721b90b44af6fb9686bb05a74005.png"]}
