{"id":"twitter:1890048020584239329","tweet_id":"1890048020584239329","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1890048020584239329","title":"This is what we call GFE, or Government Furnished Equipment. In terms of legal issues with the Privacy Act GFE makes compliance much easier. It won't ","summary":"This is what we call GFE, or Government Furnished Equipment. In terms of legal issues with the Privacy Act GFE makes compliance much easier. It won't be about access. Under the law Secretary Bessent and President Trump can authorize access to pretty much anyone.","date":"2025-02-13","published":"2025-02-13T14:38:58+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1890015180702294481","reply_tweet_id":"1890015180702294481","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>This is what we call GFE, or Government Furnished Equipment.<br><br>In terms of legal issues with the Privacy Act GFE makes compliance much easier.<br><br>It won&#x27;t be about access. Under the law Secretary Bessent and President Trump can authorize access to pretty much anyone.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1890048020584239329","display_date":"February 13, 2025 · 14:38 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
