{"id":"twitter:1888948991770927445","tweet_id":"1888948991770927445","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1888948991770927445","title":"@EricaZelic @CynicLib I do recommend Universities treat their research department differently. A Sponsored research group should think about their own","summary":"@EricaZelic @CynicLib I do recommend Universities treat their research department differently. A Sponsored research group should think about their own multi-tenant solutions. Then if faculty land a grant they could then spin up a tenant. Allows SPAR office to charge the grant and control security","date":"2025-02-10","published":"2025-02-10T13:51:49+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/EricaZelic/status/1888906906019713481","reply_tweet_id":"1888906906019713481","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@EricaZelic @CynicLib I do recommend Universities treat their research department differently. <br><br>A Sponsored research group should think about their own multi-tenant solutions. Then if faculty land a grant they could then spin up a tenant.<br><br>Allows SPAR office to charge the grant and control security</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1888948991770927445","display_date":"February 10, 2025 · 13:51 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
