{"id":"twitter:1888586647568081043","tweet_id":"1888586647568081043","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1888586647568081043","title":"Judge never added an injunction removing Secretary Bessent's authorized access. Added a temporary injunction to Bessent's authority to authorize acces","summary":"Judge never added an injunction removing Secretary Bessent's authorized access. Added a temporary injunction to Bessent's authority to authorize access. Everyone at Treasury can still access anything a civil worker needs legal access to in order to do their job. @DOGE lies https://t.co/HWAdu8BMPp","date":"2025-02-09","published":"2025-02-09T13:51:59+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Judge never added an injunction removing Secretary Bessent&#x27;s authorized access.<br><br>Added a temporary injunction to Bessent&#x27;s authority to authorize access.<br><br>Everyone at Treasury can still access anything a civil worker needs legal access to in order to do their job.<br><br>@DOGE lies <a href=\"https://t.co/HWAdu8BMPp\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/HWAdu8BMPp</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/d39f4fd6cad728d5aa7bcd5a2acde85b.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1888586647568081043","display_date":"February 09, 2025 · 13:51 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/d39f4fd6cad728d5aa7bcd5a2acde85b.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1888585496315511273","tweet_id":"1888585496315511273","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1888585496315511273","title":"The Judge never added an injunction Secretary Bessent's authorized access. He added a temporary injunction to Bessent's authority to authorize access.","summary":"The Judge never added an injunction Secretary Bessent's authorized access. He added a temporary injunction to Bessent's authority to authorize access. Everyone at Treasury can still access anything a civil worker needs legal access to in order to do their job. @DOGE lies https://t.co/xEylRmnoxi","date":"2025-02-09","published":"2025-02-09T13:47:25+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>The Judge never added an injunction Secretary Bessent&#x27;s authorized access.<br><br>He added a temporary injunction to Bessent&#x27;s authority to authorize access.<br><br>Everyone at Treasury can still access anything a civil worker needs legal access to in order to do their job.<br><br>@DOGE lies <a href=\"https://t.co/xEylRmnoxi\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/xEylRmnoxi</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/b19408caabeae278eebe5b75fd9560f2.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1888585496315511273","display_date":"February 09, 2025 · 13:47 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/b19408caabeae278eebe5b75fd9560f2.jpg"]}
