{"id":"twitter:1888379987419345023","tweet_id":"1888379987419345023","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1888379987419345023","title":"@SandSharkSec It will on Fox, but they say the access is denied, not right to grant access is injoined. Ultimately Bessent can grant authorized access","summary":"@SandSharkSec It will on Fox, but they say the access is denied, not right to grant access is injoined. Ultimately Bessent can grant authorized access. It's how FISMA is written. It's up to him then to insure federal regulations are enforced within the system.","date":"2025-02-09","published":"2025-02-09T00:10:48+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/SandSharkSec/status/1888378586836705637","reply_tweet_id":"1888378586836705637","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@SandSharkSec It will on Fox, but they say the access is denied, not right to grant access is injoined.<br><br>Ultimately Bessent can grant authorized access. It&#x27;s how FISMA is written. <br><br>It&#x27;s up to him then to insure federal regulations are enforced within the system.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1888379987419345023","display_date":"February 09, 2025 · 00:10 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
