{"id":"twitter:1888361755639775616","tweet_id":"1888361755639775616","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1888361755639775616","title":"No Senator Tom Cotton is repeating a lie he probaly read on Charlie Kirk's feed The Judge did not ban Secretary Bessent or anyone at Treasury with a l","summary":"No Senator Tom Cotton is repeating a lie he probaly read on Charlie Kirk's feed The Judge did not ban Secretary Bessent or anyone at Treasury with a legal need to access Tresuary data from that access. He put a temporary injunction on GRANTING ACCESS to non civil servants https://x.com/SenTomCotton/status/1888335201652314487 https://t.co/ZQikgaEutC","date":"2025-02-08","published":"2025-02-08T22:58:21+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>No<br><br>Senator Tom Cotton is repeating a lie he probaly read on Charlie Kirk&#x27;s feed<br><br>The Judge did not ban Secretary Bessent or anyone at Treasury with a legal need to access Tresuary data from that access.<br><br>He put a temporary injunction on GRANTING ACCESS to non civil servants <a href=\"https://x.com/SenTomCotton/status/1888335201652314487\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/SenTomCotton/status/1888335201652314487</a> <a href=\"https://t.co/ZQikgaEutC\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/ZQikgaEutC</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/13281c0b30c4b0de4727291fb7899611.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1888361755639775616","display_date":"February 08, 2025 · 22:58 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/13281c0b30c4b0de4727291fb7899611.png"]}
