{"id":"twitter:1888277797317030346","tweet_id":"1888277797317030346","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1888277797317030346","title":"@GaryMarcus That is a key difference, as you know R1 have to often hire faculty or recruit post-docs, so the fringe is real. At an R2 or below, you th","summary":"@GaryMarcus That is a key difference, as you know R1 have to often hire faculty or recruit post-docs, so the fringe is real. At an R2 or below, you the \"indirects\" go to faculty who are already on payroll. The cost of fringe makes it impossible to fund faculty or student lines","date":"2025-02-08","published":"2025-02-08T17:24:44+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1888237561065120183","reply_tweet_id":"1888237561065120183","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@GaryMarcus That is a key difference, as you know R1 have to often hire faculty or recruit post-docs, so the fringe is real.<br><br>At an R2 or below, you the &quot;indirects&quot; go to faculty who are already on payroll. The cost of fringe makes it impossible to fund faculty or student lines</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1888277797317030346","display_date":"February 08, 2025 · 17:24 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
