{"id":"twitter:1887868311897092159","tweet_id":"1887868311897092159","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1887868311897092159","title":"@Arcadecabz It is, but is isn't The stated mission of Digital Services, is close to DOGE, but the name changed A Supreme Court case in 1983 took away ","summary":"@Arcadecabz It is, but is isn't The stated mission of Digital Services, is close to DOGE, but the name changed A Supreme Court case in 1983 took away the Executive's ability to reorganize Departments. Many Presidents, Bush, Clinton, Bush, and Trump fought to get it back","date":"2025-02-07","published":"2025-02-07T14:17:35+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Arcadecabz/status/1887867539805311035","reply_tweet_id":"1887867539805311035","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Arcadecabz It is, but is isn&#x27;t<br><br>The stated mission of Digital Services, is close to DOGE, but the name changed<br><br>A Supreme Court case in 1983 took away the Executive&#x27;s ability to reorganize Departments.<br><br>Many Presidents, Bush, Clinton, Bush, and Trump fought to get it back</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1887868311897092159","display_date":"February 07, 2025 · 14:17 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
