{"id":"twitter:1887862634906526022","tweet_id":"1887862634906526022","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1887862634906526022","title":"4. There are very real concerns that the \"move fast and break things\" crowd are taking a \"compliance isn't security\" approach and putting a lot of PII","summary":"4. There are very real concerns that the \"move fast and break things\" crowd are taking a \"compliance isn't security\" approach and putting a lot of PII at risk in violation of the Privacy Act or CFR 5.","date":"2025-02-07","published":"2025-02-07T13:55:01+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1887862417188675592","reply_tweet_id":"1887862417188675592","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>4. There are very real  concerns that the &quot;move fast and break things&quot; crowd are taking a  &quot;compliance isn&#x27;t security&quot; approach and putting a lot of PII at risk in  violation of the Privacy Act or CFR 5.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1887862634906526022","display_date":"February 07, 2025 · 13:55 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1887862417188675592","tweet_id":"1887862417188675592","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1887862417188675592","title":"3. Using AI does not necessarily make it illegal or wrong. There are ChatGPT tools that can be used in High Environments. Azure AI is generally availa","summary":"3. Using AI does not necessarily make it illegal or wrong. There are ChatGPT tools that can be used in High Environments. Azure AI is generally available for Government Cloud. There are no Azure OpenAI features currently enabled that store customer data at rest for Gov","date":"2025-02-07","published":"2025-02-07T13:54:09+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1887861935456043351","reply_tweet_id":"1887861935456043351","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>3. Using AI does not necessarily make it illegal or wrong.<br><br>There are ChatGPT tools that can be used in High Environments. Azure AI is generally available for Government Cloud.<br><br>There are no Azure OpenAI features currently enabled that store customer data at rest for Gov</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1887862417188675592","display_date":"February 07, 2025 · 13:54 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1887861935456043351","tweet_id":"1887861935456043351","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1887861935456043351","title":"2. Nobody hacked access. If Secretary Bessent authorized access to Treasury , and Secretary Wright authorized access to DOE, then access is authorized","summary":"2. Nobody hacked access. If Secretary Bessent authorized access to Treasury , and Secretary Wright authorized access to DOE, then access is authorized. It is how FISMA is written. The controls that must still be met","date":"2025-02-07","published":"2025-02-07T13:52:14+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1887861713472565330","reply_tweet_id":"1887861713472565330","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>2. Nobody hacked access. If Secretary Bessent authorized access to Treasury , and Secretary Wright authorized access to DOE, then access is authorized.<br><br> It is how FISMA is written.<br><br>The controls that must still be met</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1887861935456043351","display_date":"February 07, 2025 · 13:52 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1887861713472565330","tweet_id":"1887861713472565330","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1887861713472565330","title":"Few points of order 1. We have no idea if DOGE employees have a clearance or were cleared. Either would make the actions legal. Plenty of kids under 2","summary":"Few points of order 1. We have no idea if DOGE employees have a clearance or were cleared. Either would make the actions legal. Plenty of kids under 23 do cleared work. Being a software engineer at Palintir or SpaceX means the chances are they might be cleared already.","date":"2025-02-07","published":"2025-02-07T13:51:21+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Few points of order<br><br>1. We have no idea if DOGE employees have a clearance or were cleared. Either would make the actions legal. Plenty of kids under 23 do cleared work.<br><br>Being a software engineer at Palintir or SpaceX means the chances are they might be cleared already.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1887861713472565330","display_date":"February 07, 2025 · 13:51 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
