{"id":"twitter:1887706169675764144","tweet_id":"1887706169675764144","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1887706169675764144","title":"@CallItMedusa It was kinda the first time, really. I mean there were the freepers and the Ron Paulies online first, but Tea Party was the first social","summary":"@CallItMedusa It was kinda the first time, really. I mean there were the freepers and the Ron Paulies online first, but Tea Party was the first social media driven political movements, a lot of blogs still, but social media did the work, but from day one Big money was involved","date":"2025-02-07","published":"2025-02-07T03:33:17+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/CallItMedusa/status/1887704449289699363","reply_tweet_id":"1887704449289699363","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@CallItMedusa It was kinda the first time, really. I mean there were the freepers and the Ron Paulies online first, but Tea Party was the first social media driven political movements, a lot of blogs still, but social media did the work, but from day one Big money was involved</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1887706169675764144","display_date":"February 07, 2025 · 03:33 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1887702497243849127","tweet_id":"1887702497243849127","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1887702497243849127","title":"@CallItMedusa Also happening at this time was story of \"Sharia Law\" and \"Ground Zero Mosque\" Both hitting hard in 2010, after Citizens United. The exa","summary":"@CallItMedusa Also happening at this time was story of \"Sharia Law\" and \"Ground Zero Mosque\" Both hitting hard in 2010, after Citizens United. The exact same people doing Ground Zero Mosque were training Tea Party groups on Obamacare townhall protests. That's DCI Group. Smoking is freedom","date":"2025-02-07","published":"2025-02-07T03:18:41+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1887701391491096971","reply_tweet_id":"1887701391491096971","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@CallItMedusa Also happening at this time was story of &quot;Sharia Law&quot; and &quot;Ground Zero Mosque&quot;<br><br>Both hitting hard in 2010, after Citizens United.<br><br>The exact same people doing Ground Zero Mosque were training Tea Party groups on Obamacare townhall protests.<br><br> That&#x27;s DCI Group. Smoking is freedom</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1887702497243849127","display_date":"February 07, 2025 · 03:18 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1887701391491096971","tweet_id":"1887701391491096971","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1887701391491096971","title":"@CallItMedusa Critical evaluation of socially complex texts. #TCOT and #Agenda21 is kinda what came after Tea Party, online TCOT was top conservatives","summary":"@CallItMedusa Critical evaluation of socially complex texts. #TCOT and #Agenda21 is kinda what came after Tea Party, online TCOT was top conservatives of Twitter Agenda21, in 2012, was a reprise of a John Birch lie about the UN taking over. It was climate change disinfo. Made GOP platform","date":"2025-02-07","published":"2025-02-07T03:14:18+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/CallItMedusa/status/1887699948344344983","reply_tweet_id":"1887699948344344983","tags":["TCOT","Agenda21"],"body_html":"<p>@CallItMedusa Critical evaluation of socially complex texts.<br><br> #TCOT and #Agenda21 is kinda what came after Tea Party, online<br><br>TCOT was top conservatives of Twitter<br><br>Agenda21, in 2012, was a reprise of a John Birch lie about the UN taking over. It was climate change disinfo. Made GOP platform</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1887701391491096971","display_date":"February 07, 2025 · 03:14 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
