{"id":"twitter:1887676382999662625","tweet_id":"1887676382999662625","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1887676382999662625","title":"ACLJ gave $300,000 to SCLJ with a “goal of protecting religious rights and freedoms of individuals and associations in Russia.” which meant stop the G","summary":"ACLJ gave $300,000 to SCLJ with a “goal of protecting religious rights and freedoms of individuals and associations in Russia.” which meant stop the Gays European Center for Law and Justice (ECLJ), out of France, gave and additional $1.1 million in 2012.","date":"2025-02-07","published":"2025-02-07T01:34:55+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1887675821936054285","reply_tweet_id":"1887675821936054285","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>ACLJ gave $300,000 to SCLJ with a  “goal of protecting  religious rights and freedoms of individuals and associations in  Russia.”<br><br>which meant stop the Gays<br><br>European Center for Law and Justice (ECLJ), out of  France, gave and  additional $1.1 million in 2012.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1887676382999662625","display_date":"February 07, 2025 · 01:34 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1887675821936054285","tweet_id":"1887675821936054285","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1887675821936054285","title":"In real history European Center for Law and Justice (ECLJ) and Slavic Center for Law and Justice (SCLJ) supported anti-gay laws in Russia After 2012 P","summary":"In real history European Center for Law and Justice (ECLJ) and Slavic Center for Law and Justice (SCLJ) supported anti-gay laws in Russia After 2012 Pussy Riot kerfuffle, the SCLJ called for a law criminalizing religious blasphemy. https://x.com/O_Rob1nson/status/1887250449918472268 https://t.co/ULIbU0fjVy","date":"2025-02-07","published":"2025-02-07T01:32:41+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>In real history European Center for Law and Justice (ECLJ) and Slavic  Center for Law and Justice (SCLJ) supported anti-gay laws in  Russia<br><br>After  2012 Pussy Riot kerfuffle, the SCLJ called for a law criminalizing religious blasphemy. <a href=\"https://x.com/O_Rob1nson/status/1887250449918472268\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/O_Rob1nson/status/1887250449918472268</a> <a href=\"https://t.co/ULIbU0fjVy\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/ULIbU0fjVy</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/0043f00453706e248300a5637f248bc6.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1887675821936054285","display_date":"February 07, 2025 · 01:32 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/0043f00453706e248300a5637f248bc6.jpg"]}
