{"id":"twitter:1887650841869357250","tweet_id":"1887650841869357250","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1887650841869357250","title":"You know what always scared me most about Elon, Starlink, and saving the Black Sea Fleet? It just seems like such a violation of Least Privilege and S","summary":"You know what always scared me most about Elon, Starlink, and saving the Black Sea Fleet? It just seems like such a violation of Least Privilege and Separation of Duties Like, regardless of belligerents, that should have been impossible. What's that mean for SpaceX and Tesla","date":"2025-02-06","published":"2025-02-06T23:53:26+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>You know what always scared me most about Elon, Starlink, and saving the Black Sea Fleet?<br><br>It just seems like such a violation of Least Privilege and Separation of Duties<br><br>Like, regardless of belligerents, that should have been impossible. <br><br>What&#x27;s that mean for SpaceX and Tesla</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1887650841869357250","display_date":"February 06, 2025 · 23:53 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
