{"id":"twitter:1887632966630973643","tweet_id":"1887632966630973643","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1887632966630973643","title":"In 1992 The FREEDOM Support Act was enacted into law which allowed USAID to go to independent states of the former Soviet Union. The isolationists beh","summary":"In 1992 The FREEDOM Support Act was enacted into law which allowed USAID to go to independent states of the former Soviet Union. The isolationists behind Libertarian Voices have really hated USAID ever since I wonder why. https://t.co/0OwQDlJs6g","date":"2025-02-06","published":"2025-02-06T22:42:24+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>In 1992 The FREEDOM Support Act was enacted into law which allowed USAID  to go to independent states of the former Soviet Union.<br><br>The isolationists behind Libertarian Voices have really hated USAID ever since<br><br>I wonder why. <a href=\"https://t.co/0OwQDlJs6g\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/0OwQDlJs6g</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/ea966a376d666e211a30e225aff89f44.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1887632966630973643","display_date":"February 06, 2025 · 22:42 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/ea966a376d666e211a30e225aff89f44.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1887631962132672813","tweet_id":"1887631962132672813","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1887631962132672813","title":"The goal that both Bush and Clinton has with reorganizing USAID was never to remove all support from Foreign Assistance Act. The Foreign Affairs Refor","summary":"The goal that both Bush and Clinton has with reorganizing USAID was never to remove all support from Foreign Assistance Act. The Foreign Affairs Reform and Restructuring Act of 1998 made USAID a Statutory Agency https://t.co/geQf7Sns34","date":"2025-02-06","published":"2025-02-06T22:38:24+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>The goal that both Bush and Clinton has with reorganizing USAID was never to remove all support from Foreign Assistance Act.<br><br>The Foreign Affairs Reform and Restructuring Act of 1998 made USAID  a Statutory  Agency <a href=\"https://t.co/geQf7Sns34\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/geQf7Sns34</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/985f727f02a01afbd58e8e2849e42029.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1887631962132672813","display_date":"February 06, 2025 · 22:38 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/985f727f02a01afbd58e8e2849e42029.jpg"]}
