{"id":"twitter:1887501361819910560","tweet_id":"1887501361819910560","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1887501361819910560","title":"@EyeofhorusC @craigunger @DOGE We should crowd source a spreadsheet and do a histiograph I used to scrape this data but Elon took away the API from re","summary":"@EyeofhorusC @craigunger @DOGE We should crowd source a spreadsheet and do a histiograph I used to scrape this data but Elon took away the API from researchers All the tools now are hundreds a month. My University won't pay, and by the time you get a grant, the data is gone or stale.","date":"2025-02-06","published":"2025-02-06T13:59:27+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/EyeofhorusC/status/1887500198240239748","reply_tweet_id":"1887500198240239748","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@EyeofhorusC @craigunger @DOGE We should crowd source a spreadsheet and do a histiograph<br><br>I used to scrape this data but Elon took away the API from researchers<br><br>All the tools now are hundreds a month. My University won&#x27;t pay, and by the time you get a grant, the data is gone or stale.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1887501361819910560","display_date":"February 06, 2025 · 13:59 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
