{"id":"twitter:1887332692640874749","tweet_id":"1887332692640874749","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1887332692640874749","title":"@lolsrslywtfnow @TheRynheart @JDVance No, I brought upinvestigation because it was silly to say USAID has no investigative power when you know there i","summary":"@lolsrslywtfnow @TheRynheart @JDVance No, I brought upinvestigation because it was silly to say USAID has no investigative power when you know there is an IG providing oversight That's why I shared it, then I realized how bad it is of a report for not mentioning the Black Sea incident Thanks for pointing it out","date":"2025-02-06","published":"2025-02-06T02:49:13+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/lolsrslywtfnow/status/1887332128855367768","reply_tweet_id":"1887332128855367768","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@lolsrslywtfnow @TheRynheart @JDVance No, I brought upinvestigation because it was silly to say USAID has no investigative power when you know there is an IG providing oversight<br><br>That&#x27;s why I shared it, then I realized how bad it is of a report for not mentioning the Black Sea incident<br><br>Thanks for pointing it out</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1887332692640874749","display_date":"February 06, 2025 · 02:49 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
