{"id":"twitter:1887323874905190522","tweet_id":"1887323874905190522","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1887323874905190522","title":"@LimeSnazzy It did not. 8,000,000 number is for a period from 2016 on. A subscription to Politico Pro, which isn't a Newspaper, but an aggregator for ","summary":"@LimeSnazzy It did not. 8,000,000 number is for a period from 2016 on. A subscription to Politico Pro, which isn't a Newspaper, but an aggregator for a variety of verticals, cost north of 10,0000 a year. It's like calling Reuters and Thomas Reuters the same thing DOGE blew this one","date":"2025-02-06","published":"2025-02-06T02:14:11+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/LimeSnazzy/status/1887310971800084793","reply_tweet_id":"1887310971800084793","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@LimeSnazzy It did not.<br><br> 8,000,000 number is for a period  from 2016 on.<br><br>A subscription to Politico Pro, which isn&#x27;t a Newspaper, but an aggregator for a variety of verticals, cost north of 10,0000 a year.<br><br>It&#x27;s like calling Reuters and Thomas Reuters the same thing<br><br>DOGE blew this one</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1887323874905190522","display_date":"February 06, 2025 · 02:14 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
