{"id":"twitter:1886932931848908876","tweet_id":"1886932931848908876","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1886932931848908876","title":"@NWSLtoughconvos You would be surprised how many gifted programs were just desegregation efforts, if you were being bussed. But some school districts ","summary":"@NWSLtoughconvos You would be surprised how many gifted programs were just desegregation efforts, if you were being bussed. But some school districts offer gifted services. They aren't required. There is no requirement in IDEA that an IQ test be used for gifted or students with needs.","date":"2025-02-05","published":"2025-02-05T00:20:43+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/NWSLtoughconvos/status/1886928712626569317","reply_tweet_id":"1886928712626569317","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@NWSLtoughconvos You would be surprised how many gifted programs were just desegregation efforts, if you were being bussed. <br><br>But some school districts offer gifted services.<br><br>They aren&#x27;t required. There is no requirement in IDEA that an IQ test be used for gifted or students with needs.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1886932931848908876","display_date":"February 05, 2025 · 00:20 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
