{"id":"twitter:2090908968747253976","tweet_id":"2090908968747253976","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2090908968747253976","title":"It's an open source piece: https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/08850607.2025.2522222#abstract The piece focuses more on mobilizing publics an","summary":"It's an open source piece: https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/08850607.2025.2522222#abstract The piece focuses more on mobilizing publics and introduces the concept of \"participatory intelligence communication.\" Which I really dig.","date":"2026-08-21","published":"2026-08-21T21:08:40+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2090907832145375550","reply_tweet_id":"2090907832145375550","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>It&#x27;s an open source piece: <a href=\"https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/08850607.2025.2522222#abstract\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/08850607.2025.2522222#abstract</a><br><br>The piece focuses more on mobilizing publics and introduces the concept of &quot;participatory intelligence communication.&quot;<br><br>Which I really dig.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2090908968747253976","display_date":"August 21, 2026 · 21:08 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
