{"id":"twitter:2048443574178451962","tweet_id":"2048443574178451962","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2048443574178451962","title":"It's not Ukrainian poetry, I am not Ukrainian, nor can I translate. It's a fundraiser for National Poetry Month I do every year. Currently raising mon","summary":"It's not Ukrainian poetry, I am not Ukrainian, nor can I translate. It's a fundraiser for National Poetry Month I do every year. Currently raising money for air defense in Kharkiv. A city with a rich poetic history and a dark tragedy of russia always killing the poets. https://x.com/rhapsodyboard1/status/2048441710934425855 https://t.co/rIIp7ikqHY","date":"2026-04-26","published":"2026-04-26T16:46:20+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>It&#x27;s not Ukrainian poetry, I am not Ukrainian, nor can I translate.<br><br>It&#x27;s a fundraiser for National Poetry Month I do every year.<br><br>Currently raising money for air defense in Kharkiv.<br><br>A city with a rich poetic history and a dark tragedy of russia always killing the poets. <a href=\"https://x.com/rhapsodyboard1/status/2048441710934425855\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/rhapsodyboard1/status/2048441710934425855</a> <a href=\"https://t.co/rIIp7ikqHY\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/rIIp7ikqHY</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/349f6f342711b2a36157fbe6bf84a37c.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2048443574178451962","display_date":"April 26, 2026 · 16:46 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/349f6f342711b2a36157fbe6bf84a37c.jpg"]}
