{"id":"twitter:1886867124481876435","tweet_id":"1886867124481876435","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1886867124481876435","title":"Congress established the Office of the Commissioner of Internal Revenue under the Department of the Treasury. On July 17, 1862 The Revenue Act of June","summary":"Congress established the Office of the Commissioner of Internal Revenue under the Department of the Treasury. On July 17, 1862 The Revenue Act of June 30, 1864, authorized the Commissioner of Internal Revenue to compromise all suits “relating to internal revenue,”","date":"2025-02-04","published":"2025-02-04T19:59:13+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1886866934836457724","reply_tweet_id":"1886866934836457724","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Congress established the Office of the Commissioner of Internal Revenue under the Department of the Treasury. On July 17, 1862<br><br>The Revenue Act of June 30, 1864, authorized the Commissioner of  Internal Revenue to compromise all suits “relating to internal revenue,”</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1886867124481876435","display_date":"February 04, 2025 · 19:59 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
