{"id":"twitter:1886408992500412569","tweet_id":"1886408992500412569","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1886408992500412569","title":"@davetroy My thing with the Mandates for Leadership is people got to stop reading just Mandate IX and realize Project 1980 was Mandate I, and they are","summary":"@davetroy My thing with the Mandates for Leadership is people got to stop reading just Mandate IX and realize Project 1980 was Mandate I, and they are the same. I am in 100% agreement with you. Elon is doing this to benefit Xi and Putin from NATO STRATCOM COE's recent report https://t.co/bR3jJBsdek","date":"2025-02-03","published":"2025-02-03T13:38:46+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/davetroy/status/1886407326157914575","reply_tweet_id":"1886407326157914575","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@davetroy My thing with the Mandates for Leadership is people got to stop reading just Mandate IX<br><br>and realize Project 1980 was Mandate I, and they are the same.<br><br>I am in 100% agreement with you. Elon is doing this to benefit Xi and Putin<br><br>from NATO STRATCOM COE&#x27;s recent report <a href=\"https://t.co/bR3jJBsdek\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/bR3jJBsdek</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/94fc6ee4c62ffc6558cce23f7a01c2bc.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1886408992500412569","display_date":"February 03, 2025 · 13:38 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/94fc6ee4c62ffc6558cce23f7a01c2bc.png"]}
{"id":"twitter:1886407028932743614","tweet_id":"1886407028932743614","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1886407028932743614","title":"@davetroy Heritage has long been after USAID. Earliest reference I can find without going deep in archives in 2007. https://www.heritage.org/global-po","summary":"@davetroy Heritage has long been after USAID. Earliest reference I can find without going deep in archives in 2007. https://www.heritage.org/global-politics/report/foreign-aid-congress-should-shift-usaid-funds-the-millennium-challenge https://www.heritage.org/defense/report/obsolete-restrictions-public-diplomacy-hurt-us-outreach-and-strategy In short, Herita","date":"2025-02-03","published":"2025-02-03T13:30:58+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/davetroy/status/1886388655977009247","reply_tweet_id":"1886388655977009247","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@davetroy Heritage has long been after USAID. Earliest reference I can find without going deep in archives in 2007.<br><br><a href=\"https://www.heritage.org/global-politics/report/foreign-aid-congress-should-shift-usaid-funds-the-millennium-challenge\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://www.heritage.org/global-politics/report/foreign-aid-congress-should-shift-usaid-funds-the-millennium-challenge</a><br><br><a href=\"https://www.heritage.org/defense/report/obsolete-restrictions-public-diplomacy-hurt-us-outreach-and-strategy\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://www.heritage.org/defense/report/obsolete-restrictions-public-diplomacy-hurt-us-outreach-and-strategy</a><br><br>In short, Heritage Foundation is Project Russia.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1886407028932743614","display_date":"February 03, 2025 · 13:30 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
