{"id":"twitter:1885748694198178031","tweet_id":"1885748694198178031","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1885748694198178031","title":"The State of California sends about 2.5 million acre-feet of water to urban areas What would salty water do to all the pump infrastructure to move wat","summary":"The State of California sends about 2.5 million acre-feet of water to urban areas What would salty water do to all the pump infrastructure to move water down to Southern California? It would be bad, very bad","date":"2025-02-01","published":"2025-02-01T17:54:58+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1885748017153688010","reply_tweet_id":"1885748017153688010","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>The State of California sends about 2.5 million acre-feet of water to urban areas<br><br>What would salty water do to all the pump infrastructure to move water down to Southern California?<br><br>It would be bad, very bad</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1885748694198178031","display_date":"February 01, 2025 · 17:54 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1885748017153688010","tweet_id":"1885748017153688010","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1885748017153688010","title":"Of the almost 7 million acre feet of water taking from the Delta, 5 million acre-feet, go to farms. What would happen if that water was all salinated?","summary":"Of the almost 7 million acre feet of water taking from the Delta, 5 million acre-feet, go to farms. What would happen if that water was all salinated? That would be bad, real bad","date":"2025-02-01","published":"2025-02-01T17:52:17+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1885747500562174318","reply_tweet_id":"1885747500562174318","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Of the almost 7 million acre feet of water taking from the Delta, 5 million acre-feet, go to farms.<br><br>What would happen if that water was all salinated?<br><br>That would be bad, real bad</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1885748017153688010","display_date":"February 01, 2025 · 17:52 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1885747500562174318","tweet_id":"1885747500562174318","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1885747500562174318","title":"Here's the thing....if LA, which water storage isn't the problem, took more Delata water the outflow to the Pacific would be too low This would then a","summary":"Here's the thing....if LA, which water storage isn't the problem, took more Delata water the outflow to the Pacific would be too low This would then allow more salty, brackish water to come in from the Pacific That would be bad, real bad https://t.co/RkJ15Aesur","date":"2025-02-01","published":"2025-02-01T17:50:14+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1885745940180435372","reply_tweet_id":"1885745940180435372","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Here&#x27;s the thing....if LA, which water storage isn&#x27;t the problem, took more Delata water the outflow to the Pacific would be too low<br><br>This would then allow more salty, brackish water to come in from the Pacific<br><br>That would be bad, real bad <a href=\"https://t.co/RkJ15Aesur\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/RkJ15Aesur</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/ff87829ae393cb8e49ec43dcae4289fa.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1885747500562174318","display_date":"February 01, 2025 · 17:50 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/ff87829ae393cb8e49ec43dcae4289fa.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1885745940180435372","tweet_id":"1885745940180435372","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1885745940180435372","title":"This is the estuary. The water would have never reached the reservoirs in Los Angeles The levees are not how the Delta Water gets pumped to the reserv","summary":"This is the estuary. The water would have never reached the reservoirs in Los Angeles The levees are not how the Delta Water gets pumped to the reservoirs. Trump was just literally releasing more water into the Pacific to stop all the water from getting to the Pacific https://t.co/acc4nTLTA1","date":"2025-02-01","published":"2025-02-01T17:44:02+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1885745078381019169","reply_tweet_id":"1885745078381019169","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>This is the estuary. The water would have never reached the reservoirs in Los Angeles<br><br>The levees are not how the Delta Water gets pumped to the reservoirs.<br><br>Trump was just literally releasing more water into the Pacific to stop all the water from getting to the Pacific <a href=\"https://t.co/acc4nTLTA1\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/acc4nTLTA1</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/7d004f095737e93fe327bb764b9f90eb.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1885745940180435372","display_date":"February 01, 2025 · 17:44 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/7d004f095737e93fe327bb764b9f90eb.jpg"]}
