{"id":"twitter:1885486980248555556","tweet_id":"1885486980248555556","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1885486980248555556","title":"In 1978, the newly formed think tank, The Heritage Foundation would put out a piece on \"Family Choice in Education as the Next Imperative\" ...while Pa","summary":"In 1978, the newly formed think tank, The Heritage Foundation would put out a piece on \"Family Choice in Education as the Next Imperative\" ...while Paul Weyrich and Bob Jones University were suing to keep tax exempt status, even if the school remained segregated In 1978 https://t.co/uE36ynvpBP","date":"2025-02-01","published":"2025-02-01T00:35:01+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1885486569785581958","reply_tweet_id":"1885486569785581958","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>In 1978, the newly formed think tank, The Heritage Foundation would put out a piece on &quot;Family Choice in Education as the Next Imperative&quot;<br><br>...while Paul Weyrich and Bob Jones University were suing to keep tax exempt status, even if the school remained segregated<br><br>In 1978 <a href=\"https://t.co/uE36ynvpBP\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/uE36ynvpBP</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/87aa384c189a8ce0835128f1e4f2aa3d.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1885486980248555556","display_date":"February 01, 2025 · 00:35 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/87aa384c189a8ce0835128f1e4f2aa3d.png"]}
{"id":"twitter:1885486569785581958","tweet_id":"1885486569785581958","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1885486569785581958","title":"See because what also happened was Carter made the Department of Education And that made people really mad, and they want it closed. Sound familiar?","summary":"See because what also happened was Carter made the Department of Education And that made people really mad, and they want it closed. Sound familiar?","date":"2025-02-01","published":"2025-02-01T00:33:23+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1885485648305394046","reply_tweet_id":"1885485648305394046","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>See because what also happened was Carter made the Department of Education<br><br>And that made people really mad, and they want it closed.<br><br>Sound familiar?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1885486569785581958","display_date":"February 01, 2025 · 00:33 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1885485648305394046","tweet_id":"1885485648305394046","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1885485648305394046","title":"This is the \"return freedom to the family\" crowd (though research shows all the vouchers going to upper middle class families who already send kids to","summary":"This is the \"return freedom to the family\" crowd (though research shows all the vouchers going to upper middle class families who already send kids to Private school) When Weyrich would go on to start the Heritage Foundation he took the idea of school vouchers with him https://t.co/kx6wvvVXta","date":"2025-02-01","published":"2025-02-01T00:29:43+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1885484212364403146","reply_tweet_id":"1885484212364403146","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>This is the &quot;return freedom to the family&quot; crowd<br><br>(though research shows all the vouchers going to upper middle class families who already send kids to Private school)<br><br>When Weyrich would go on to start the Heritage Foundation he took the idea of school vouchers with him <a href=\"https://t.co/kx6wvvVXta\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/kx6wvvVXta</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/3b21bbd123a6b52272109381e0552cb9.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1885485648305394046","display_date":"February 01, 2025 · 00:29 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/3b21bbd123a6b52272109381e0552cb9.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1885484212364403146","tweet_id":"1885484212364403146","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1885484212364403146","title":"The history with Segregationists and school choice started as far back as Brown vs th Board of Education But it would flare up again when Bob Jones Un","summary":"The history with Segregationists and school choice started as far back as Brown vs th Board of Education But it would flare up again when Bob Jones University wanted to segregate and stay tax free, in 1978 https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1766157379861618737","date":"2025-02-01","published":"2025-02-01T00:24:01+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1885483740333326819","reply_tweet_id":"1885483740333326819","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>The history with Segregationists and school choice started as far back as Brown vs th Board of Education<br><br>But it would flare up again when Bob Jones University wanted to segregate and stay tax free, in 1978<br><br><a href=\"https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1766157379861618737\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1766157379861618737</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1885484212364403146","display_date":"February 01, 2025 · 00:24 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1885483740333326819","tweet_id":"1885483740333326819","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1885483740333326819","title":"And for parents frustrated for testing we offer market based solutions of private schools which aren't subject to the same testing that that Accountab","summary":"And for parents frustrated for testing we offer market based solutions of private schools which aren't subject to the same testing that that Accountability folks demand of public schools. Basically make school suck more, and offer an alternative","date":"2025-02-01","published":"2025-02-01T00:22:08+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1885483289114194242","reply_tweet_id":"1885483289114194242","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>And for parents frustrated for testing we offer market based solutions of private schools<br><br>which aren&#x27;t subject to the same testing that that Accountability folks demand of public schools.<br><br>Basically make school suck more, and offer an alternative</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1885483740333326819","display_date":"February 01, 2025 · 00:22 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1885483289114194242","tweet_id":"1885483289114194242","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1885483289114194242","title":"In terms of the school improvement that's the Hayek/Friedman neoliberal branch that markets know best. And to thrive they must be free of government. ","summary":"In terms of the school improvement that's the Hayek/Friedman neoliberal branch that markets know best. And to thrive they must be free of government. For schools to improve, we must first hold them accountable. So over the decades, we have added an ass load of testing","date":"2025-02-01","published":"2025-02-01T00:20:21+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1885482837551235486","reply_tweet_id":"1885482837551235486","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>In terms of the school improvement that&#x27;s the Hayek/Friedman neoliberal branch that markets know best.<br><br>And to thrive they must be free of government.<br><br>For schools to improve, we must first hold them accountable.<br><br>So over the decades, we have added an ass load of testing</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1885483289114194242","display_date":"February 01, 2025 · 00:20 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
