{"id":"twitter:1885359711735759278","tweet_id":"1885359711735759278","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1885359711735759278","title":"Twitter was once an amazing place for teachers. I could stop in any time and get answers and perspectives and tips There were chats scheduled every da","summary":"Twitter was once an amazing place for teachers. I could stop in any time and get answers and perspectives and tips There were chats scheduled every day, on the hour, for so many topics That's all gone now. Elon broke it","date":"2025-01-31","published":"2025-01-31T16:09:18+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Twitter was once an amazing place for teachers. I could stop in any time and get answers and perspectives and tips<br><br>There were chats scheduled every day, on the hour, for so many topics<br><br>That&#x27;s all gone now.<br><br>Elon broke it</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1885359711735759278","display_date":"January 31, 2025 · 16:09 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
