{"id":"twitter:1885152505593581706","tweet_id":"1885152505593581706","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1885152505593581706","title":"not saying there is culpability. Being a risk doesn't mean you leaked the PI from Federal systems. And Palintir has better guard rails than Enron Musk","summary":"not saying there is culpability. Being a risk doesn't mean you leaked the PI from Federal systems. And Palintir has better guard rails than Enron Musk and xAI. very specific, and not hard rules to follow with PI. covered by laws, can't be \"unclassified\" ( aren't classified)","date":"2025-01-31","published":"2025-01-31T02:25:56+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1884981975326273702","reply_tweet_id":"1884981975326273702","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>not saying there is culpability. Being a risk doesn&#x27;t mean you leaked the PI from Federal systems.<br><br>And Palintir has better guard rails than Enron Musk and xAI.<br><br> very specific, and not hard rules to follow with PI.<br><br>covered by laws, can&#x27;t be  &quot;unclassified&quot; ( aren&#x27;t classified)</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1885152505593581706","display_date":"January 31, 2025 · 02:25 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
