{"id":"twitter:1884993606722723998","tweet_id":"1884993606722723998","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1884993606722723998","title":"@alicenotmiller Most of my russian friends are russian Jews, so have very good reasons to hate russia, and they or their parents have memories of Sovi","summary":"@alicenotmiller Most of my russian friends are russian Jews, so have very good reasons to hate russia, and they or their parents have memories of Soviet time Until late 70s most Jewish folks allowed to emigrate came to America not Israel In 1990s everyone came. Now, on Twitter? I dunno.","date":"2025-01-30","published":"2025-01-30T15:54:31+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/alicenotmiller/status/1884992150355443816","reply_tweet_id":"1884992150355443816","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@alicenotmiller Most of my russian friends are russian Jews, so  have very good reasons to hate russia, and they or their parents have memories of Soviet time<br><br>Until  late 70s most Jewish folks allowed to emigrate came to America not Israel <br><br>In 1990s everyone came.<br><br>Now, on Twitter? I dunno.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1884993606722723998","display_date":"January 30, 2025 · 15:54 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
