{"id":"twitter:1884981975326273702","tweet_id":"1884981975326273702","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1884981975326273702","title":"The entire transition was designed to stay off Federal Systems. Folks need to understand all cybersecurity regulations flow through Commerce and then ","summary":"The entire transition was designed to stay off Federal Systems. Folks need to understand all cybersecurity regulations flow through Commerce and then through OMB. How FISMA is written. Comingling of Palintir, xAI, and OPM systems is a massive internal threat. PI was leaked https://x.com/MuellerSheWrote/status/1884979848323682314","date":"2025-01-30","published":"2025-01-30T15:08:18+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>The entire transition was designed to stay off Federal Systems.<br><br>Folks need to understand all cybersecurity regulations flow through Commerce and then through OMB.<br><br>How FISMA is written.<br><br>Comingling of Palintir, xAI, and OPM systems is a massive internal threat.<br><br>PI was leaked <a href=\"https://x.com/MuellerSheWrote/status/1884979848323682314\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/MuellerSheWrote/status/1884979848323682314</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1884981975326273702","display_date":"January 30, 2025 · 15:08 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
