{"id":"twitter:1884256818614132841","tweet_id":"1884256818614132841","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1884256818614132841","title":"@KenDuval5 @craigunger By Executive Order? The entire point is birthright citizenship is an archaic element of sovereign Kings and English Common Law.","summary":"@KenDuval5 @craigunger By Executive Order? The entire point is birthright citizenship is an archaic element of sovereign Kings and English Common Law. But you are arguing for a Unitary Executive who can just declare who is a sovereign citizen and who isn't. Can you see the issue?","date":"2025-01-28","published":"2025-01-28T15:06:48+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/KenDuval5/status/1884255949218816200","reply_tweet_id":"1884255949218816200","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@KenDuval5 @craigunger By Executive Order?<br><br>The entire point is birthright citizenship is an archaic element of sovereign Kings and English Common Law.<br><br>But you are arguing for a Unitary Executive who can just declare who is a sovereign citizen and who isn&#x27;t.<br><br>Can you see the issue?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1884256818614132841","display_date":"January 28, 2025 · 15:06 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
