{"id":"twitter:1883934443855089716","tweet_id":"1883934443855089716","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1883934443855089716","title":"People donated to their trusts all the time, but Scaife figured out how to make a 501c(3) And 504c(4) to move the profits of a trust into donations to","summary":"People donated to their trusts all the time, but Scaife figured out how to make a 501c(3) And 504c(4) to move the profits of a trust into donations to push specific agendas. Instead of building libraries or funding operas you create things like David Koch's CATO Institute","date":"2025-01-27","published":"2025-01-27T17:45:47+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1883909359723487359","reply_tweet_id":"1883909359723487359","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>People donated to their trusts all the time, but Scaife figured out how to make a 501c(3) And 504c(4) to move the profits of a trust into donations to push specific agendas.<br><br>Instead of building libraries or funding operas you create things like David Koch&#x27;s CATO Institute</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1883934443855089716","display_date":"January 27, 2025 · 17:45 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1883933054147891632","tweet_id":"1883933054147891632","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1883933054147891632","title":"See Richard Scaife figured something out. Ever since Income tax was passed in 1913, rich people have not wanted to pay taxes. In 1915 a law was set up","summary":"See Richard Scaife figured something out. Ever since Income tax was passed in 1913, rich people have not wanted to pay taxes. In 1915 a law was set up allowing blind trusts. If someone donated ALL the profits the trust made up, you could give it away tax free after 20 years","date":"2025-01-27","published":"2025-01-27T17:40:16+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1883909359723487359","reply_tweet_id":"1883909359723487359","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>See Richard Scaife figured something out. <br><br>Ever since Income tax was passed in 1913, rich people have not wanted to pay taxes.<br><br>In 1915 a law was set up allowing blind trusts. If someone donated ALL the profits the trust made up, you could give it away tax free after 20 years</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1883933054147891632","display_date":"January 27, 2025 · 17:40 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
