{"id":"twitter:1883908208626126945","tweet_id":"1883908208626126945","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1883908208626126945","title":"Where did idea that taxes on billionaires and regulation = threat to freedom really take off? While tying God and BigBiz as a counterweight to communi","summary":"Where did idea that taxes on billionaires and regulation = threat to freedom really take off? While tying God and BigBiz as a counterweight to communism goes back to early 1900s it was really the Powell Memo by future Supreme Court justice Lewis F. Powell, Jr. modernized it https://t.co/YjKkOcaFFu","date":"2025-01-27","published":"2025-01-27T16:01:32+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Where did  idea that taxes on billionaires and regulation = threat to freedom really take off?<br><br>While tying God and BigBiz as a counterweight to communism goes back to early 1900s it was really the Powell Memo by future Supreme Court justice Lewis F. Powell, Jr. modernized it <a href=\"https://t.co/YjKkOcaFFu\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/YjKkOcaFFu</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/71264122e38271fe6c29bbf8cd79259d.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1883908208626126945","display_date":"January 27, 2025 · 16:01 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/71264122e38271fe6c29bbf8cd79259d.png"]}
