{"id":"twitter:1883586828080763005","tweet_id":"1883586828080763005","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1883586828080763005","title":"@infosec_fox And the reality is becoming you will not get insurance, or worse won't have claims paid if you can't prove you: -Backup -Incident Respons","summary":"@infosec_fox And the reality is becoming you will not get insurance, or worse won't have claims paid if you can't prove you: -Backup -Incident Respons -MFA -Phish train (even if dumb) -EDR etc So cyber is an investment in avoiding more expesive things but risk management vs risk avoidance","date":"2025-01-26","published":"2025-01-26T18:44:29+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1883583488714264924","reply_tweet_id":"1883583488714264924","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@infosec_fox And the reality is becoming you will not get insurance, or worse won&#x27;t have claims paid if you can&#x27;t prove you:<br><br>-Backup<br>-Incident Respons<br>-MFA<br>-Phish train (even if dumb)<br>-EDR<br>etc<br><br>So cyber is an investment in avoiding more expesive things<br><br>but risk management vs risk avoidance</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1883586828080763005","display_date":"January 26, 2025 · 18:44 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
